  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/#main-content)\n\n# GlobalTechnology  Solutions\n\nStandardized Deployment and Support.\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![team meeting using global technology solutions](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/iStock-1220226091-scaled.webp)\n\n### Consistent user experiences   around the globe\n\nWe deploy your standardized AV and unified communications solutions around the world. Our global teams support centralized business decisions. You have a single point of contact at AVI-SPL while our in-country support teams deliver localized service.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/#contact)\n\n### Keep Global Teams Connected\n\nGlobal Management with\n\n24/7 Local Support\nGlobal RFP Expertise\n\nUnified Communications\n\n![AVI-SPL technician servicing financial services av equipment](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shot83R-1-scaled.webp)\n\nOur teams work together with you across borders and time zones to provide. Your project manager delivers clear communication to your global and local personnel throughout the deployment process and ongoing 24/7 support.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/services/)\n\n![global RFP hybrid team meeting](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shot78-scaled.webp)\n\nOur teams ensure global RFP responses include accurate project details based on local and regional requirements. We consider power and measurement systems, local laws, tax codes, and language and cultural considerations.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/#contact)\n\n![global team using unified communications platform](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shot53-1-scaled.webp)\n\nAVI-SPL is your go-to global provider to enable your teams with Cisco Webex, Google Workspace, Microsoft Teams, Zoom, or another platform. We develop UC technology standards to ensure a consistent user experience.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/solutions/unified-communications-collaboration/)\n\n### Global UC and collaboration    for a more connected world\n\nOur Other services\n\n### Keepingyourteamand  yourbusinessconnected\n\n[Contact](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/#contact)\n\n[![A woman at a desk joins a video call on a laptop with four smiling people, holding a pen and notebook by charts and papers.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Voice-cloud-calling-Img-v2-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Collaboration as a Service**](https://avispl.com/services/collaboration-as-a-service/) [![A person in a headset and black vest smiles while working at a computer, with multiple monitors and a screen showing Dublin.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Managed-Services-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Managed Services**](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/) [![Lecture hall with rows of chairs, tables facing screens showing AVI-SPL logo; overhead lights, exit signs visible.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Rose-State-Colleges-Tanenbaum-Aerospace-and-Cybersecurity-Center-tiered-lecture-hall-with-Epson-projectors-on-1024x594.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Professional Services**](https://avispl.com/services/professional-services/)\n\n12\n\n### News\n\nSee how we elevate events and environments through tailored audio-visual solutions.\n\n[View All](https://avispl.com/news/)\n\n[![Diverse students sit on amphitheater steps, focused on a presenter by a screen with colorful data graphics.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Lifestyle_EDU_136_AIO_CummunalGather-LG-scaled-1.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\nBlog\\\\\n\\\\\n**4 steps to maintaining a flexible, inclusive HyFlex learning experience** View more](https://avispl.com/blog/4-steps-to-maintaining-a-flexible-inclusive-hyflex-learning-experience/) [![A bald man in a black top sits with a guitar and a world map behind. A computer shows 12:11, with Dana Corey, SVP & GM, Avocor.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Dana-Corey-Avocor-podcast-screenshot.png)\\\\\n\\\\\nBlog\\\\\n\\\\\n**Choose tools that deliver human-centric experiences in hybrid meeting spaces** View more](https://avispl.com/blog/deliver-human-centric-experiences-in-hybrid-meeting-spaces/) [![Thank You! AVI SPL 🎉 Were top rated on TrustRadius. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ [Blue hexagonal badge: TrustRadius Top Rated 2024] Geometric patterns.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/LinkedIn-Post-Blank-Logo-Space-AVI-SPL-WEB-2558px-1.webp)\\\\\n\\\\\nBlog\\\\\n\\\\\n**AVI-SPL celebrates 2024 TrustRadius Top Rated Awards in 8 categories!** View more](https://avispl.com/blog/avi-spl-celebrates-2024-trustradius-top-rated-awards-in-8-categories/)\n\n13\n\n### Partners\n\nWe partner with leading collaboration providers.\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)",
